  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集说到二零零八年，北京奥运郎平带美国队赢了中国队，被全中国骂成吃里扒外。很多人以为他这辈子不会再回来了，毕竟他不欠谁。第一次回国救火，她离了婚丢了，家住十平米宿舍，一年挣六千两百七十块，把一盘散沙的女排带进了奥运决赛。然后呢，身体垮了，没人管他他去美国治病带美国队，赢了一场球，就成了千古罪人。换做是你，你还会回来吗？他回来了。二零一三年，中国女排又跌到了世界第五，没人敢接主教练这个位置赢了是应该的，输了就是千古罪人。五十三岁的郎平髌骨已经摘了膝盖，动过十几次手术，走路都会不疼。领导问他还能拼吗？他说，能就一个字，他把朱婷、袁新月、张常宁这些十几岁的小孩招进队，那时候他们还是小树苗，没人知道这帮孩子能不能打出来。郎平每天熬到半夜看录像，房间的灯永远最后一个灭。二零一五年世界杯主力伤了一半，媒体说中国队是去陪跑的，对于俄罗斯先输后赢，第四局落后，身后就是悬崖，郎平叫暂停，只说了一句，输了也认，但不能怂。对日本三比一，时隔十一年，中国女排重回世界之巅，但真正封神的是二零一六年，里约小组赛输了三场，勉强第四，出现八强战打巴西东道主。此前对中国队十八连败，一场没赢过二万人的场馆，嘘声震天。巴西球迷都在提前庆祝郎平教暂停，对着姑娘们喊，听见了吗？这是战鼓，第五局比分焦灼。巴西主教练的孙子在场边被打哭了之前，发球几乎不失误的谢了。关键时刻，发球出界送给中国队赛点朱婷一记中扣一锤定音三比二翻盘了。赛后，她转过身抹了一把眼泪，说了一句，这一刻，我等了二十年。二十年。从一九九六年亚特兰大的银牌到二零一六年里约的金牌，他等了整整二十年，决赛对塞尔维亚先丢一局。他叫暂停，说，放开打天塌下来，我顶着第四局。二十三平张常宁发球，对方送探头，惠若琪一记探头打中冠军十二年，中国女排重回奥运之巅。二零一九年，世界杯十一连胜，一场没输，强势夺冠。一向沉稳的郎平哭了最后一场比赛，她把十四个队员队员全换上场，每个人都打了，不是来拍手的。然后是二零二一年东京伤病满盈，小组赛没出现，创造了队史最差战绩。舆论瞬间翻脸，说，她毁了中国女排，舆论瞬会捞金，她一个人把所有责任揽下来。卸任。赛后，姑娘们排成一排，给他深深鞠了一躬，张常宁望着他，眼睛里全是泪。采访的时候，郎平哭着说，我向大家道歉，我没带好，你算算从一九八一年到二零二一年，整整四十年，别人退役了，当官，他退役了，去留学，别人安稳的享福，他一次次在最低谷的时候站出来，别人被骂了就躲，他被骂完了还敢回来。他叫郎平外号，铁榔头榔头是干嘛的？砸困难的。他这一辈子砸开过世界冠军的大门，砸开过，治暗，时刻砸开过所有的质疑和骂声。最狠的一锤不是扣向日本队的那个制胜球，是每次被骂到骨子里，他依然敢说一句，我能拼。这样的人不该被忘记，觉得解气的点赞，觉得该让更多人知道的转发，怕以后找不到的收藏，关注我，下一个人物更狠。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 2790,
      "text": "上集说到二零零八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2830,
      "end_ms": 6450,
      "text": "北京奥运郎平带美国队赢了中国队，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00003",
      "start_ms": 6770,
      "end_ms": 9610,
      "text": "被全中国骂成吃里扒外。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00004",
      "start_ms": 10190,
      "end_ms": 13270,
      "text": "很多人以为他这辈子不会再回来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00005",
      "start_ms": 13570,
      "end_ms": 15290,
      "text": "毕竟他不欠谁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00006",
      "start_ms": 16610,
      "end_ms": 18050,
      "text": "第一次回国救火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00007",
      "start_ms": 18310,
      "end_ms": 19910,
      "text": "她离了婚丢了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00008",
      "start_ms": 19910,
      "end_ms": 21890,
      "text": "家住十平米宿舍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00009",
      "start_ms": 22130,
      "end_ms": 24510,
      "text": "一年挣六千两百七十块，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00010",
      "start_ms": 25070,
      "end_ms": 28650,
      "text": "把一盘散沙的女排带进了奥运决赛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00011",
      "start_ms": 29270,
      "end_ms": 29905,
      "text": "然后呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00012",
      "start_ms": 30200,
      "end_ms": 31260,
      "text": "身体垮了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00013",
      "start_ms": 31340,
      "end_ms": 35860,
      "text": "没人管他他去美国治病带美国队，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00014",
      "start_ms": 37560,
      "end_ms": 38500,
      "text": "赢了一场球，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00015",
      "start_ms": 38680,
      "end_ms": 40540,
      "text": "就成了千古罪人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00016",
      "start_ms": 40940,
      "end_ms": 41840,
      "text": "换做是你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00017",
      "start_ms": 42020,
      "end_ms": 43220,
      "text": "你还会回来吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00018",
      "start_ms": 43720,
      "end_ms": 44540,
      "text": "他回来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00019",
      "start_ms": 44680,
      "end_ms": 45620,
      "text": "二零一三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00020",
      "start_ms": 45860,
      "end_ms": 47880,
      "text": "中国女排又跌到了世界第五，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00021",
      "start_ms": 48340,
      "end_ms": 51900,
      "text": "没人敢接主教练这个位置赢了是应该的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00022",
      "start_ms": 52140,
      "end_ms": 53700,
      "text": "输了就是千古罪人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00023",
      "start_ms": 54140,
      "end_ms": 57900,
      "text": "五十三岁的郎平髌骨已经摘了膝盖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00024",
      "start_ms": 57900,
      "end_ms": 59200,
      "text": "动过十几次手术，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00025",
      "start_ms": 59480,
      "end_ms": 60325,
      "text": "走路都会不疼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00026",
      "start_ms": 61270,
      "end_ms": 64315,
      "text": "领导问他还能拼吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00027",
      "start_ms": 64810,
      "end_ms": 65285,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00028",
      "start_ms": 65660,
      "end_ms": 67165,
      "text": "能就一个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00029",
      "start_ms": 67670,
      "end_ms": 72990,
      "text": "他把朱婷、袁新月、张常宁这些十几岁的小孩招进队，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00030",
      "start_ms": 73050,
      "end_ms": 75165,
      "text": "那时候他们还是小树苗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00031",
      "start_ms": 75670,
      "end_ms": 78605,
      "text": "没人知道这帮孩子能不能打出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00032",
      "start_ms": 79250,
      "end_ms": 81645,
      "text": "郎平每天熬到半夜看录像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00033",
      "start_ms": 82020,
      "end_ms": 84495,
      "text": "房间的灯永远最后一个灭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00034",
      "start_ms": 85330,
      "end_ms": 88535,
      "text": "二零一五年世界杯主力伤了一半，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00035",
      "start_ms": 88930,
      "end_ms": 91265,
      "text": "媒体说中国队是去陪跑的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00036",
      "start_ms": 91700,
      "end_ms": 94135,
      "text": "对于俄罗斯先输后赢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00037",
      "start_ms": 94520,
      "end_ms": 95620,
      "text": "第四局落后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00038",
      "start_ms": 95940,
      "end_ms": 97105,
      "text": "身后就是悬崖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00039",
      "start_ms": 97960,
      "end_ms": 99145,
      "text": "郎平叫暂停，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00040",
      "start_ms": 99510,
      "end_ms": 100425,
      "text": "只说了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00041",
      "start_ms": 100820,
      "end_ms": 101615,
      "text": "输了也认，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00042",
      "start_ms": 101900,
      "end_ms": 102655,
      "text": "但不能怂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00043",
      "start_ms": 103480,
      "end_ms": 106165,
      "text": "对日本三比一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00044",
      "start_ms": 107100,
      "end_ms": 108235,
      "text": "时隔十一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00045",
      "start_ms": 109120,
      "end_ms": 111660,
      "text": "中国女排重回世界之巅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00046",
      "start_ms": 111740,
      "end_ms": 114950,
      "text": "但真正封神的是二零一六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00047",
      "start_ms": 114950,
      "end_ms": 117295,
      "text": "里约小组赛输了三场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00048",
      "start_ms": 117640,
      "end_ms": 119020,
      "text": "勉强第四，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00049",
      "start_ms": 119020,
      "end_ms": 122400,
      "text": "出现八强战打巴西东道主。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00050",
      "start_ms": 122760,
      "end_ms": 124800,
      "text": "此前对中国队十八连败，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00051",
      "start_ms": 124980,
      "end_ms": 127959,
      "text": "一场没赢过二万人的场馆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00052",
      "start_ms": 128300,
      "end_ms": 129460,
      "text": "嘘声震天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00053",
      "start_ms": 129940,
      "end_ms": 133540,
      "text": "巴西球迷都在提前庆祝郎平教暂停，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00054",
      "start_ms": 133900,
      "end_ms": 134960,
      "text": "对着姑娘们喊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00055",
      "start_ms": 135340,
      "end_ms": 136080,
      "text": "听见了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00056",
      "start_ms": 136840,
      "end_ms": 137660,
      "text": "这是战鼓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00057",
      "start_ms": 138600,
      "end_ms": 140720,
      "text": "第五局比分焦灼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00058",
      "start_ms": 141420,
      "end_ms": 145080,
      "text": "巴西主教练的孙子在场边被打哭了之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00059",
      "start_ms": 145120,
      "end_ms": 147120,
      "text": "发球几乎不失误的谢了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00060",
      "start_ms": 147200,
      "end_ms": 148140,
      "text": "关键时刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00061",
      "start_ms": 148320,
      "end_ms": 156730,
      "text": "发球出界送给中国队赛点朱婷一记中扣一锤定音三比二翻盘了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00062",
      "start_ms": 157690,
      "end_ms": 158110,
      "text": "赛后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00063",
      "start_ms": 158110,
      "end_ms": 160430,
      "text": "她转过身抹了一把眼泪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00064",
      "start_ms": 160770,
      "end_ms": 161510,
      "text": "说了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00065",
      "start_ms": 162050,
      "end_ms": 162710,
      "text": "这一刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00066",
      "start_ms": 163010,
      "end_ms": 164390,
      "text": "我等了二十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00067",
      "start_ms": 165530,
      "end_ms": 166169,
      "text": "二十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00068",
      "start_ms": 166470,
      "end_ms": 172690,
      "text": "从一九九六年亚特兰大的银牌到二零一六年里约的金牌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00069",
      "start_ms": 173350,
      "end_ms": 175330,
      "text": "他等了整整二十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00070",
      "start_ms": 176490,
      "end_ms": 179765,
      "text": "决赛对塞尔维亚先丢一局。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00071",
      "start_ms": 180180,
      "end_ms": 180980,
      "text": "他叫暂停，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00072",
      "start_ms": 181340,
      "end_ms": 181580,
      "text": "说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00073",
      "start_ms": 181600,
      "end_ms": 183440,
      "text": "放开打天塌下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00074",
      "start_ms": 183440,
      "end_ms": 186640,
      "text": "我顶着第四局。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00075",
      "start_ms": 186780,
      "end_ms": 189680,
      "text": "二十三平张常宁发球，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00076",
      "start_ms": 190500,
      "end_ms": 191720,
      "text": "对方送探头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00077",
      "start_ms": 192740,
      "end_ms": 198060,
      "text": "惠若琪一记探头打中冠军十二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00078",
      "start_ms": 199120,
      "end_ms": 201960,
      "text": "中国女排重回奥运之巅。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00079",
      "start_ms": 203640,
      "end_ms": 204640,
      "text": "二零一九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00080",
      "start_ms": 204660,
      "end_ms": 206560,
      "text": "世界杯十一连胜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00081",
      "start_ms": 207000,
      "end_ms": 207940,
      "text": "一场没输，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00082",
      "start_ms": 208420,
      "end_ms": 209620,
      "text": "强势夺冠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00083",
      "start_ms": 210000,
      "end_ms": 214460,
      "text": "一向沉稳的郎平哭了最后一场比赛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00084",
      "start_ms": 214700,
      "end_ms": 217110,
      "text": "她把十四个队员队员全换上场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00085",
      "start_ms": 217490,
      "end_ms": 218670,
      "text": "每个人都打了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00086",
      "start_ms": 218970,
      "end_ms": 220350,
      "text": "不是来拍手的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00087",
      "start_ms": 220850,
      "end_ms": 224830,
      "text": "然后是二零二一年东京伤病满盈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00088",
      "start_ms": 225210,
      "end_ms": 226750,
      "text": "小组赛没出现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00089",
      "start_ms": 226830,
      "end_ms": 228970,
      "text": "创造了队史最差战绩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00090",
      "start_ms": 229570,
      "end_ms": 231050,
      "text": "舆论瞬间翻脸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00091",
      "start_ms": 231390,
      "end_ms": 231590,
      "text": "说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00092",
      "start_ms": 231590,
      "end_ms": 232790,
      "text": "她毁了中国女排，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00093",
      "start_ms": 233090,
      "end_ms": 234230,
      "text": "舆论瞬会捞金，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00094",
      "start_ms": 234830,
      "end_ms": 236910,
      "text": "她一个人把所有责任揽下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00095",
      "start_ms": 237130,
      "end_ms": 237690,
      "text": "卸任。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00096",
      "start_ms": 238010,
      "end_ms": 238470,
      "text": "赛后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00097",
      "start_ms": 238930,
      "end_ms": 240475,
      "text": "姑娘们排成一排，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00098",
      "start_ms": 241090,
      "end_ms": 242715,
      "text": "给他深深鞠了一躬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00099",
      "start_ms": 243730,
      "end_ms": 244975,
      "text": "张常宁望着他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00100",
      "start_ms": 245600,
      "end_ms": 246975,
      "text": "眼睛里全是泪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00101",
      "start_ms": 247850,
      "end_ms": 248935,
      "text": "采访的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00102",
      "start_ms": 249330,
      "end_ms": 250495,
      "text": "郎平哭着说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00103",
      "start_ms": 251500,
      "end_ms": 252565,
      "text": "我向大家道歉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00104",
      "start_ms": 253580,
      "end_ms": 254340,
      "text": "我没带好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00105",
      "start_ms": 254460,
      "end_ms": 259525,
      "text": "你算算从一九八一年到二零二一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00106",
      "start_ms": 260090,
      "end_ms": 261535,
      "text": "整整四十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00107",
      "start_ms": 261920,
      "end_ms": 262760,
      "text": "别人退役了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00108",
      "start_ms": 262760,
      "end_ms": 263255,
      "text": "当官，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00109",
      "start_ms": 263610,
      "end_ms": 264190,
      "text": "他退役了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00110",
      "start_ms": 264190,
      "end_ms": 264790,
      "text": "去留学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00111",
      "start_ms": 264930,
      "end_ms": 266450,
      "text": "别人安稳的享福，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00112",
      "start_ms": 266690,
      "end_ms": 269285,
      "text": "他一次次在最低谷的时候站出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00113",
      "start_ms": 270150,
      "end_ms": 271470,
      "text": "别人被骂了就躲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00114",
      "start_ms": 271910,
      "end_ms": 273495,
      "text": "他被骂完了还敢回来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00115",
      "start_ms": 273730,
      "end_ms": 275330,
      "text": "他叫郎平外号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00116",
      "start_ms": 275330,
      "end_ms": 278165,
      "text": "铁榔头榔头是干嘛的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00117",
      "start_ms": 278540,
      "end_ms": 279445,
      "text": "砸困难的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00118",
      "start_ms": 280980,
      "end_ms": 284445,
      "text": "他这一辈子砸开过世界冠军的大门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00119",
      "start_ms": 285010,
      "end_ms": 285670,
      "text": "砸开过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00120",
      "start_ms": 285710,
      "end_ms": 286210,
      "text": "治暗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00121",
      "start_ms": 286230,
      "end_ms": 289295,
      "text": "时刻砸开过所有的质疑和骂声。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00122",
      "start_ms": 290400,
      "end_ms": 295045,
      "text": "最狠的一锤不是扣向日本队的那个制胜球，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00123",
      "start_ms": 295530,
      "end_ms": 297815,
      "text": "是每次被骂到骨子里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00124",
      "start_ms": 298100,
      "end_ms": 299600,
      "text": "他依然敢说一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00125",
      "start_ms": 299900,
      "end_ms": 301015,
      "text": "我能拼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00126",
      "start_ms": 301500,
      "end_ms": 303065,
      "text": "这样的人不该被忘记，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00127",
      "start_ms": 303440,
      "end_ms": 306010,
      "text": "觉得解气的点赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00128",
      "start_ms": 306320,
      "end_ms": 309745,
      "text": "觉得该让更多人知道的转发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00129",
      "start_ms": 310530,
      "end_ms": 312700,
      "text": "怕以后找不到的收藏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00130",
      "start_ms": 313180,
      "end_ms": 313765,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fb07bcb46e2752c2_s00131",
      "start_ms": 314050,
      "end_ms": 316545,
      "text": "下一个人物更狠。"
    }
  ],
